# Base580 Obsidian Wiki

Vault path: `C:\Users\carlo\Documents\base580\base580-infra`

All AIs working on Base580 (infra, backend, frontend) MUST use this vault as the shared knowledge base.

## Before answering project questions

1. Read `wiki/hot.md` first
2. If needed, read `wiki/index.md`
3. Then drill into specific pages under `wiki/`

## When you learn durable facts

Write or update pages under `wiki/`, then:

- Update `wiki/index.md`
- Overwrite `wiki/hot.md` with recent context (~500 words)
- Prepend an entry to `wiki/log.md` (newest on top)

Never modify files in `.raw/`. Drop new sources there and ingest into `wiki/sources/`.

Schema and conventions: `CLAUDE.md` at the vault root.
